70. The number is:", "options": [{"text": "1980", "added": false}, {"text": "5940", "added": false}, {"text": "3960", "added": false}, {"text": "990", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "increase-decrease", "key_answer": "1980"}, {"n": 29, "text": "If 330 persons can complete the construction of a shopping complex in 50 days, how many persons are required to complete the same work in 30 days?", "options": [{"text": "550", "added": false}, {"text": "450", "added": false}, {"text": "198", "added": false}, {"text": "505", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Work", "sub": "together-apart", "key_answer": "550"}, {"n": 30, "text": "A man sold an article for ₹481 by first giving a d% discount on its marked price, and then another discount having the same nominal value (in ₹). If the marked price of the article is ₹1924, then what is the value of d?", "options": [{"text": "42.5", "added": false}, {"text": "37.5", "added": false}, {"text": "32", "added": false}, {"text": "33", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Discount", "sub": "mp-sp-relation", "key_answer": "37.5"}, {"n": 31, "text": "An electric refrigerator rated 400 W operates 8 hours/day. What is the cost of the energy to operate it for 30 days at ₹3.00 per kW h?", "options": [{"text": "₹400", "added": false}, {"text": "₹36", "added": false}, {"text": "₹288", "added": false}, {"text": "₹9.6", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Boats-Streams", "sub": "upstream-downstream", "key_answer": "64 hours"}, {"n": 32, "text": "A cube of side 5 cm is cut into smaller cubes of side 1 cm. What is the ratio of the total surface area of the larger cube and the sum of the total surfaces of all the smaller cubes?", "options": [{"text": "1 : 5", "added": false}, {"text": "1 : 3", "added": false}, {"text": "2 : 5", "added": false}, {"text": "2 : 3", "added